OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening. Then a dry night with
OL,7,Fsome clear spells, though some patchy
OL,8,Flow cloud is likely to develop in the
OL,9,Feast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,12,Fsome good sunny spells. Becoming very
OL,13,Fwarm or hot, with light winds.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,16,FThursday will be sunny and hot. Friday
OL,17,Fand Saturday cloudier, mainly dry but
OL,18,Fthe odd shower, especially in west,
OL,19,Fless warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
